    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d308">

                <pb facs="0436" n="356" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg356"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">President Palma to
                        President Roosevelt</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-09-04"><hi rendition="#italic">September 4,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I profoundly deplore the accident that has befallen Your Excellency and make
                    sincere wishes for the complete restoration of your health.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. Estrada Palma</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
